                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "i love playing as Hubert, and the barking. and the fetch. and the sheep.\nbut i feel like there wasn't a lot of... really anything, for a game tagged as story rich and emotional i was expecting something more impactful... and it could have been, but it was just a bunch of fetch quests (pun intended) that didn't do anything for character growth.\ni managed to finish it in 4 ish hours, which was surprising i expected a little more crisis and resolution but really only got a little crisis and a resolution that didn't feel good?, complete?, gratifying? it just left me wanting and a little dissppointed (especially for the price tag).\nall in all there really wasn't a lot there contents wise, i expected more sheep related tasks and got really into herding the sheep (theres something good there if only it was explored more in depth), but even that didn't feel like the main part of it. i couldn't understand if we were trying to find our place in the world, or if blindly following lilly was something we wanted or were happy with doing and i think this just comes back to the fact that the conflilt and resolution were not gratifying\nthere wasn't a lot of character building, just alot of \"oh we do this now?\" even with hubert's fear of water you wouldn't be able to tell other than the game over screen you get from failling a jump, there was no sense of hesitency near water at all just alot of \"i don't like this thing\" and does it anyways.\ni love the dog model, the eyes are a little jarrinly human at times but just running around and barking is probably my second favourite part.\nall in all this makes me feel like a beta tester instead of experiencing a fullfledged game so for those reasons i do not reccomend this game, but that might change if future updates are on the cards",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792057684,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1792057684,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 77,
                        "votes_funny": 3,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.8702750205993652,
                        "comment_count": 3,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thanks for playing Hubert and taking the time to share your thoughts! We're sorry the story didn't resonate with you the way we'd hoped. We wanted to tell a relatively small, personal story through the eyes of a dog, but we understand it won't land the same way for everyone. We're really glad you enjoyed the herding and simply being Hubert, though. Thanks again for giving him a chance!",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1792059858,
